{% from "art.njk" import bear, projectArt %}
<section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
  <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> FIELD NOTES FROM A CURIOUS LIFE</p><h1 id="welcome-title">A small den.<br> A <em>wide</em> world.</h1><p class="hero-intro">Hello, I’m Bear. Scientist by trade,<br class="desktop-break"> collector of curiosities by nature.</p><p class="hero-fields">Coastal oceanography · Energy & environment · Applied physics</p><p class="hero-description">Come in for the ocean science. Stay for the wiggling lines, ambitious plush bears, and ideas that wander a little.</p><a class="button" href="#projects">Explore the projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="hero-aside">there’s a bit of everything here</span></div>
  <div class="hero-scrapbook"><span class="hand-note photo-note">the resident bear <span aria-hidden="true">⤵</span></span><figure class="polaroid"><span class="tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% if site.avatar %}<img class="avatar" src="{{ site.avatar }}" alt="{{ site.avatarAlt }}" width="1254" height="1254" fetchpriority="high">{% else %}<div class="avatar-placeholder"><span>{{ bear() }}</span><p>A place for the resident bear.</p></div>{% endif %}<figcaption>Bear, in his natural habitat.<span>{% if site.avatarTemporary %}A little illustrated stand-in, for now.{% else %}At home in the den.{% endif %}</span></figcaption></figure><span class="stamp" aria-hidden="true">STAY<br> CURIOUS<span>✳</span></span><div class="small-note"><span class="note-pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>currently collecting:<br> <strong>good questions &<br> interesting things</strong></div></div>
</section>
<div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true"><div class="shell"><span>OCEANS & OTHER WONDERS</span><span>✳</span><span>MAPS & WIGGLING LINES</span><span>✳</span><span>PLUSHY CITIZENS</span><span>✳</span><span>SMALL EXPERIMENTS</span></div></div>
<section id="projects" class="projects-section shell" aria-labelledby="projects-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / THINGS I’M TINKERING WITH</p><h2 id="projects-title">Three corners of the den.</h2></div><span class="hand-note">pick a rabbit hole <span aria-hidden="true">↙</span></span></div><div class="project-grid">{% for project in projects %}<article class="project-card"><a href="{{ project.url }}" class="project-card-link"><div class="project-art art-{{ project.art }}">{{ projectArt(project.art) }}<span class="project-number">{{ project.number }}</span></div><div class="project-card-body"><span class="eyebrow">{{ project.label }}</span><h3>{{ project.title }}</h3><p>{{ project.description }}</p><span class="project-open">Open the notebook <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div></a></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="journal-section shell" aria-labelledby="notes-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE OCCASIONAL TANGENT</p><h2 id="notes-title">Notes from the Den</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/journal/">Visit the journal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>{% if collections.journal.length %}{% set entries = collections.journal %}{% include "entry-list.njk" %}{% else %}<div class="journal-empty"><div class="notebook-doodle" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 110" fill="none"><path d="m20 14 58-6 10 86-58 6Z" fill="#e9dfc5" stroke="#6b7055" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m27 13 10 86M38 35l30-3M40 47l30-3M41 59l23-2" stroke="#6b7055" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m68 78 20-35 8 5-20 35-10 8Z" fill="#ad7857" stroke="#6b7055" stroke-width="2"/></svg></div><div><span class="hand-note">a fresh page, for now.</span><h3>Good things take a little wandering.</h3><p>Field notes, half-formed ideas, small discoveries, and the occasional meme.<br> The first entry is still finding its way here.</p></div><span class="paper-label">NO RUSH.<br> JUST CURIOSITY.</span></div>{% endif %}</section>
